Texas Linux Fest 2026 branding
==============================

The images in files/branding/ are the Texas Linux Fest 2026 logos, taken from
https://github.com/TXLF/2026website at commit 8f5c478b37fa52d12763284f228af2583b09c91f
(see files/branding/SOURCE.md). That repository has no license file, and the
logos are the event's trademark. They are included here only for the TXLF 2026
demo, with permission of the Texas Linux Fest organizers.
